    "body": "Claim released. STOPPED at Step 5 because the required stacked baseline already fixes this issue.\nPR #2206 adds the missing Gate map in crates/app/tests/post_script_options.rs (commit da9b72de5; tested head e289b2425).\nI stacked on #2206 as required by the same-header overlap rule.\nThe new pin gate_maps_tests::post_options_change_selects_the_script_options_suite passes without an implementation change.\ncargo test -p xtask gate_maps_tests -- --nocapture passes all 9 tests, including no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app.\nThe pin confirms that a setup_post_options module change selects post_script_options.\nThis is fixed in the open prerequisite PR, not yet in upstream/main.\nNo separate fix PR was opened. The temporary pin and worktree were discarded.\nThe maintainer can resolve #2233 after #2206 lands.\n",
